  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shiraka Training Programme &#x2013; Trade Promotion and Economic Diplomacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this annual course is for civil servants and relevant semi-public organisations working in the field of economic diplomacy to share their knowledge and skills, enabling them to lead and inspire the modernisation of trade promotion in their home countries.The course also aims to strengthen participants&apos; ties with the Netherlands and stakeholders in the Dutch trade promotion sector.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
